  m_Text: "The place seems empty until a shadow moves between them. There\u2019s a locked exit with a token slot beside it, so collect enough tokens and bring them back to the machine. Switch views to check your surroundings and use the wall vents to move between rooms. Keep track of what\u2019s behind you."
